'''M80''' is an [[:category:United_States|American]] esports organization.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4

|content1=
* July 15th - '''M80''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' by signing a roster consisting of [[Swisher]], [[reck]], [[WolfY]], [[malbsMd]], and [[maNkz]], with the latter two being acquired from [[LOS + oNe]] and [[ECSTATIC]], respectively. Additionally, [[dephh]] is appointed as coach. <ref name="M80 CS">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/M80gg/status/1680276092609785857|title=NA Counter Strike has never looked better|date=2023-07-15|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
* November 11th - '''M80''' part ways with [[WolfY]]. <ref name="-wolfy">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/M80gg/status/1723577904703869408|title=Thank you @IWolfyCS|date=2023-11-11|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
* November 13th - '''M80''' acquire [[slaxz-]] from [[ALTERNATE aTTaX]]. <ref name="+slaxz-">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/M80gg/status/1724157311222944242|title=Welcome the newest addition to M80 Counter-Strike, @slaxzcs!|date=2023-11-13|author='''M80'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 28th - [[maNkz]] steps down from the active lineup due to personal reasons. <ref name="maNkz inactive">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/m80gg/status/1751621244720480482|title=M80 Counter-Strike Update|date=2024-01-28|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
* February 29th - '''M80''' sign [[stamina]] as an analyst. <ref name="+stamina">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/M80gg/status/1763343936834138170|title=We are also excited to announce @stamjna will be supporting the team as an analyst through the RMR, IEM Chengdu, and EPL|date=2024-02-29|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
* March 26th - '''M80''' acquire [[s1n]] from [[BIG]]. <ref name="+s1n">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/M80gg/status/1772672672616366175|title=We haven’t had an IGL in a while|date=2024-03-26|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
* June 18th - '''M80''' part ways with [[malbsMd]] after he is acquired by an undisclosed organization, later revealed to be [[G2 Esports]]. <ref name="-malbsMd">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/m80gg/status/1803124426323665126|title=Don't cry because it's over. Smile because it happened|date=2024-06-18|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
* June 25th - [[stamina]] steps down from '''M80'''. <ref name="-stamina">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/stamjna/status/1805635531218231737|title=As of today I am no longer with @M80gg|date=2024-06-25|author=[[stamina]]}}</ref>
* July 9th - '''M80''' sign [[Lake]]. <ref name="m80 lake">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/M80gg/status/1810766096624144460|title=A young star is born|date=2024-07-09|author='''M80'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* May 7th - '''M80''' release [[maNkz]]. <ref name="-maNkz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/mankzCS/status/1920177481224454491|title=Hello everyone!|date=2025-05-07|author=[[maNkz]]}}</ref>
* July 7th - '''M80''' bench [[reck]] and acquire [[HexT]] from [[NRG]] as his replacement. <ref name="reck bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/M80gg/status/1942227434818212234|title=a 2 year long journey|date=2025-07-07|author='''M80'''}}</ref><ref name="+HexT">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/M80gg/status/1942282669267591304|title=we just got even louder|date=2025-07-07|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
* August 15th - [[reck]] is acquired by [[SportsBetExpert]]. <ref name="-reck">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SBETeam/status/1956491602794349027|title=SPORTS BET EXPERT CS2 IS HONORED AND THRILLED TO ANNOUNCE THE PICKUP OF @RECKFTP|date=2025-08-15|author=[[SportsBetExpert]]}}</ref>
* December 15th - '''M80''' release [[HexT]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-HexT">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/M80gg/status/2000632125637427557|title=With the expiration of his contract we want to thank @HexTCSGO for being a part of M80|date=2025-12-15|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
* December 16th - '''M80''' acquire [[JBa]] from [[Wildcard]]. <ref name="+JBa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/M80gg/status/2000989438835319227|title=welcome @JBafps to M80!|date=2025-12-16|author='''M80'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* June 10th - '''M80''' sign [[Munstur]] as an analyst. <ref name="+munstur analyst">{{inside source|source=Munstur}}</ref>
* August 11th - '''M80''' promote [[Munstur]] to an assistant coach role. <ref name="+munstur">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/M80gg/status/2087193879543988603|title=the last piece to our CS2 puzzle|date=2026-08-11|author='''M80'''}}</ref>
}}

